## What changed (`AppUtils.java`, −44 lines net)

Added one helper:
```java
@Nullable
private static PackageInfo getPackageInfo(final String packageName) {
    if (UtilsBridge.isSpace(packageName)) return null;
    try {
        PackageManager pm = Utils.getApp().getPackageManager();
        return pm.getPackageInfo(packageName, 0);
